      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEPUNGA SCARLETT (8) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but had to settle for a minor placing when a 7 length third over 390m at Shepparton, clocking 22.18. Is yet to miss the placings from this draw, including two wins, from four starts. Can go on with it. SWEET LOVE (1) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in three starts, including two wins. Hit the frame latest (24.12) when third at Bendigo in a Free For All. Looks suited here and can measure up. FLYING INTENTION (4) continued her winning form with another strong run after leading them home recording back to back wins at Bendigo over 425m (23.96). The form out of her last race has been franked. One of the prime contenders. CHEEKY MEEKI (6) boasts a solid strike-rate over this trip.",
